r loss (-)</td><td>-308,680</td><td>-308,680</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [160, 1245, 807, 1322], \"page_id\": 108}], \"content\": \"Beginning July 1974, the International Monetary Fund adopted a technique for valuing the SDRs based on a weighted average of exchange rates for the currencies of selected member countries. The U.S. SDR holdings and allocations are valued on this basis beginning July 1974.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [843, 1245, 1470, 1355], \"page_id\": 108}], \"content\": \"Note.\\u2014 Annual balance sheets for fiscal years 1934 through 1940 appeared in the 1940 \\\"Annual Report of the Secretary of the Treasury\\\" and those for succeeding years appeared in subsequent reports through 1980. Quarterly balance sheets beginning with December 31, 1938, have been published in the \\\"Treasury Bulletin.\\\" Data from inception to September 30, 1978, may be found on the statements published in the January 1979 \\\"Treasury Bulletin.\\\"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1392, 2048, 1488, 2072], \"page_id\": 108}], \"content\": \"June 2006\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1066, 191, 1486, 361], \"page_id\": 109}], \"content\": \"SPECIAL\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1346, 427, 1486, 469], \"page_id\": 109}], \"content\": \"Trust Funds\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1107, 368, 1486, 401], \"page_id\": 109}], \"content\": \"REPORTS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [719, 94, 911, 125], \"page_id\": 110}], \"content\": \"TRUST FUNDS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1441, 99, 1490, 125], \"page_id\": 110}], \"c