diesel fuels, special motor fuels, aviation fuels and\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [836, 238, 1499, 415], \"page_id\": 128}], \"content\": \"fuels used in commercial transportation on inland waterways. Amounts avail able in the LUST Trust Fund, ex ceed ing cur rent ex pen di ture re quire ments, are in vested by the Sec re tary of the Treasury in interest-bearing Government securities (e.g., Treasury bills). All in ter est earned is cred ited di rectly to the LUST Trust Fund.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 415, 1499, 500], \"page_id\": 128}], \"content\": \"To carry out the LUST pro gram, amounts are ap pro pri- ated for the LUST Trust Fund to the EPA for pro gram matic and administrative expenses.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 500, 1495, 644], \"page_id\": 128}], \"content\": \"An annual report to Congress by the Secretary of the Treasury is re quired by 26 United States Code 9602(a). These reports present the financial condition of the LUST Trust Fund and re sults of op er a tions for the past fis cal year and its ex pected condition and operations during the next 5 fiscal years.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [357, 672, 1271, 745], \"page_id\": 128}], \"content\": \"TABLE TF-17.\\u2014Leaking Underground Storage Tank Trust Fund Results of Operations, Fiscal 2000\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [758, 768, 867, 794], \"page_id\": 128}], \"content\": \"[Source: EPA]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 808, 1494, 1285], \"page_id\": 128}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Balance Oct. 1, 1999</td><td>$1,377,000,000</td></tr><tr><td>Receipts:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Taxes</td><td>184,000,000</td></tr><tr><td>Interest</td><td>77,000,000</td></tr